## Building

Build through the Unreal Editor, via RunUAT, or with a project build script:

**RunUAT (default):**
```
# Windows
RunUAT.bat BuildPlugin -Plugin="[path to .uplugin]" -TargetPlatforms=Win64

# Mac
RunUAT.sh BuildPlugin -Plugin="[path to .uplugin]" -TargetPlatforms=Mac
```

**Build scripts (if present):**
```powershell
# Windows (build.ps1)
.\build.ps1 -UEVersion {{UE_VERSION}}    # Build for target version
.\build.ps1 -All                          # Build all detected versions
.\build.ps1 -WhatIf                       # Preview detected UE installations
```
```bash
# Mac/Linux (build.sh)
./build.sh -v {{UE_VERSION}}              # Build for target version
./build.sh --all                          # Build all detected versions
./build.sh --whatif                       # Preview detected UE installations
```

Logs are saved to `BuildLogs/Build_<version>_<timestamp>.log` when using build scripts.

Use `/build-check` to verify the project compiles.

